data: {"id": "ca47a29ae19441eb-thinking-parallel_evidence-2267", "run_id": "ca47a29ae19441eb", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "所有首轮采集已完成，现在汇总事实、冲突和缺口。\n\n---\n\n## 已采集事实\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n|------|------|\n| **Kubernetes 状态** | Pod `workload-68c557d875-bsq52` (UID `78de30b1-...`) 当前状态为 **Pending**，`node` 为 `<none>`，IP 为 `<none>`，`PodScheduled` condition = `False` |\n| **调度事件** | `default-scheduler` 报 **FailedScheduling**，原文：`0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`。最近一次 22m 前（重复 7 次），首次 57m 前 |\n| **调度约束** | `nodeSelector: {\"aiops.lab/unavailable\": \"true\"}` |\n| **集群节点** | 3 个节点 (master, node1, no", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788763765419, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

